    <decisions>
        <name>Item_Receipt_Changed_Decision_Sync</name>
        <label>Item Receipt Changed? (Sync)</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Not Changed</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Item_Receipt_Was_Changed</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>Item_Receipt_Changed_Formula</leftValueReference>
                <operator>EqualTo</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>true</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Old_Parent_IR_Products</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Item Receipt Was Changed</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <decisions>
        <name>Item_Receipt_Is_Null_Check_Async</name>
        <label>Item Receipt Is Null Check (Async)</label>
        <locationX>0</locationX>
        <locationY>0</locationY>
        <defaultConnectorLabel>Default Outcome</defaultConnectorLabel>
        <rules>
            <name>Is_Not_Null_Async</name>
            <conditionLogic>and</conditionLogic>
            <conditions>
                <leftValueReference>$Record.Item_Receipt__c</leftValueReference>
                <operator>IsNull</operator>
                <rightValue>
                    <booleanValue>false</booleanValue>
                </rightValue>
            </conditions>
            <connector>
                <targetReference>Get_Current_Parent_IR_Products</targetReference>
            </connector>
            <label>Is Not Null</label>
        </rules>
    </decisions>
    <description>06/04/26 (GD) – DLRS-replacement: Total_IR_Product_Cost (on update). Sync path uses $Record__Prior to recalculate the old parent when Item_Receipt__c is reparented. Async path recalculates the current parent on any qualifying change. Known gap: if Item_Receipt__c is cleared to null, the old parent is not recalculated.</description>
    <environments>Default</environments>
    <formulas>
        <name>Item_Receipt_Changed_Formula</name>
        <dataType>Boolean</dataType>
        <expression>AND(NOT({!$Record.Item_Receipt__c} = {!$Record__Prior.Item_Receipt__c}), NOT(ISNULL({!$Record__Prior.Item_Receipt__c})))</expression>
    </formulas>
    <interviewLabel>IR Product | On Update, Total IR Product Cost Roll Up {!$Flow.CurrentDateTime}</interviewLabel>
    <label>IR Product | On Update, Total IR Product Cost Roll Up</label>
